    "description": {
      "type": "String",
      "label": "Description",
      "value": "<p><strong>Domain:</strong> Once per battle on your respective turns as a free action, you and your allies may each adjust the natural value of a single d20 roll downward by 1 (typically to trigger a result which would usually only work on a natural odd or even roll). An ally must be nearby you in order to use this blessing.</p>"
