    "effect": {
      "type": "String",
      "label": "Effect",
      "value": "<p>This battle, you and each of your allies can each separately reduce the difficulty value of a single save in order to end an ongoing condition by one step&mdash;Hard (16+) is reduced to Normal (11+), Normal (11+) is reduced to Easy (6+), and an Easy (6+) save automatically succeeds the next time the character would make the roll. This difficulty reduction persists until you or that ally succeeds on the save, or until the battle ends.</p>"
    },
