        "description": {
          "type": "String",
          "value": "<p>As a free action at any time (typically after an enemy attack is rolled but before its damage and other effects are resolved), you can revoke this benefit for yourself and all allies who have not yet used it in order to add the escalation die [[@ed]] to a single ally&rsquo;s AC or PD (you choose which one is affected). You cannot bestow this defense bonus on yourself.</p>"
